window.products.push({"id":825012,"name":"Vera Wang - King Sheets, Cotton Percale Bedding Set, Crisp & Cool Home Decor (White/Charcoal, King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":126.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y6abMsNIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The everyday luxury of pure cotton percale makes the Vera Wang Solid 400 Thread Count Sheet Set the perfect choice for an effortlessly elegant bedroom. Available in white or charcoal, these luxurious solid sheets are finished with gorgeous hem stitching. This set includes a fully elasticized fitted sheet that prevents slipping from your mattress and ensures a perfect fit. These sheets fit mattresses up to 22\" deep and are machine washable for easy and convenient care. The sheet set is Oeko-Tex certified, which ensures that these textiles meet high safety and environmental standards. Queen sheet set includes: one flat sheet (102\"L x 94\"W), one fitted sheet (80\"L x 60\"W) and two pillowcases (20\"L x 32\"W). King sheet set includes: one flat sheet (102\"L x 112\"W), one fitted shet (80\"L x 78\"W) and two pillowcases (20\"L x 40\"W).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y6abMsNIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vera Wang","source_asin":"B08HXQ123T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-825012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HXQ123T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HXQ123T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":825013,"name":"Candoury Satin Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin, King Size Set of 2 Pillow Cases, Soft Silky Pillow Covers 2 Pack with Envelope Closure (20x40, Dark ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v4ZJzJ9ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Quality】 Made from the finest quality satin polyester, Our silky pillowcases will meet all your needs for a classy pillowcase and a durable one. You will feel silky and fall in love with its softness as you lay your head on it. 【Say Goodbye to Messy Hair】 The silky fabric provides excellent protection for the hair, and sleeping on satin pillowcase will help keep your hair moisturized and healthy, reducing tangles, frizz and breakage. Pillowcases help hair retain its natural oils, giving it a healthy shine. The beauty of the day starts with waking up! 【Cosmetic Effect】 Are you worried about the wrinkles on your face? Are you concerned that they may be getting worse? It could be your pillowcase causing you all that. Candoury satin pillowcases will help you ensure that your face remains wrinkles even in old age. The silk satin pillow case comes with an innovative cosmetic effect that allows your skin to remain smooth. 【Envelope Sealing】 We know how frustrating it can be when the pillowcase zipper catches on to your hair or gets stuck as you try to take out the pillow. We help you overcome this through our careful envelope design. Of course, it can also lock the pillow firmly, so there is no need to worry about the pillow escaping when falling into a dream. 【Easy to Wash】 Compared with silk pillowcases, satin pillowcases are easier to keep clean. You can quickly wash the pillowcases by hand wash or if you prefer a machine-wash, that will work fine as well. The 100% satin polyester remains in good condition after each wash. Additionally, these pillowcase dry quickly when you hand them out to dry in the sun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v4ZJzJ9ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Candoury","source_asin":"B08DZWCXCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-825013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DZWCXCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DZWCXCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
