window.products.push({"id":825081,"name":"SEANCHEER Small Car Vacuum Cordless Rechargeable, 7000Pa/120W Mini Car Vacuum Cleaner, Detachable Handheld Vacuum Cordless with LED Flashlight/powerba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RzP2Hq0xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3 in 1 car vacuum】 Car vacuum cleaner +LED flashlight + power bank. This vacuum has a decent suction power of 7000Pa, quickly to tidy up every single corner of your vehicle or small workbench. The detachable handle can be used as a flashlight and power bank.The flashlight with 110 lumen strong light will be a great helper when you looking for something in the car or when you need to repair your broken down car. Also served as a nice emergency power bank when you need to charge your phone. 【Detachable Design】 Always forget to charge your small car vaccum? The handle(with battery inside) of this hand vacuum cordless rechargeable is detachable. With size of 5 x 1.7 x 1.4in and weight of 0.3lb, convenient for you to put the compact handle into pocket to take it home or restaurant for charging. The handle can also be taken out of your car in hot days to avoid high temperature for safety reasons. 【4000mAh Battery & Type-C import】 Small car vacuum equipped with 4000mAh large capacity battery and 5V 2A type-C charging port, it takes only about 2.5 hours to be fully charged, can work for 30-40 minutes on one full charge, no need of frequent charging. Charging indicator lights allow you to check charging status and remaining electric quantity easily. Can charge this car vacuum by household sockets, laptops, mobile power, and car USB ports. 【3 Suction Mouths & Easy to Clean】Small vacuum cleaner comes with 3 different mouths to better meet your cleaning needs. Wide Mouth is for cleaning dust, biscuit crumbs, sand, etc. Crevice Mouth is for hard-to-reach parts, such as car narrow gap and window gaps. Upgraded Brush Mouth with bushy brush hair perfects for cleaning car air conditioner vent, laptop keyboard and more. 2 washable HEPA filters and cleaning brush included makes it easy to clean. NOTE: Please dry the filter before reusing it. 【Lightweight & Portable】Worried about inconvenient storage of portable car vacuum? The handheld vacuum is small with size of 6.9 x 2.4 x 2.4in and weighs 0.8lb. Detachable design enhances it’s mobility and convenience. Can be easily stored in car glove box, or carried anywhere. Comes with a storage bag, it’s big enough for the vacuum itself and all pieces that come with it. No more worry about no right place to store or losing accessories!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RzP2Hq0xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEANCHEER","source_asin":"B0BTCPWWPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-825081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTCPWWPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTCPWWPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
