window.products.push({"id":825196,"name":"50g Mooncake Mold, Chinese Shaped Words Moon Cake Molder Set 6 Pcs for Mid-Autumn Festival, Hand-Pressure DIY Mould Accessories for Cake Cookie Desser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SFQg2z04L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥮【PREMIUM QUALITY】-Our Mid-Autumn Mooncake Mould 50g is made of high-quality ABS food grade material and has a sturdy structure for durability, you can rest assured to use it! Each mold is designed in 3D, which can make your pastry look more beautiful. 🥮【YOU WILL GET】-You will get 1 mold 4 stamps The unique design of the mold. Chinese characters are attached with flower designs. Comes with 4 stamps with different designs, you can change the stamps to make different sizes of cookies or mooncakes. 🥮【EASY TO USE AND CLEAN】-The plastic hand pressure mold is very easy to use, but the pattern into the barrel-shaped mooncake mold, tighten the seal clockwise, then put the dough into the mold, press the handle to compact it, and finally pull up the handle to release the mooncake to get a mooncake with a beautiful pattern! Also, this is a removable design that can be easily cleaned. 🥮【WIDELY APPLICATION】-This mold is a great choice for pastry-making DIY. This is not only used for moon cakes but also perfect for making pumpkin cakes, Vietnamese cookies, pastries, desserts, and more. When you give your friends or relatives these homemade pastries, they will be excited and complimented. And this is the perfect gift for Housewives, and DIY pastry cooking enthusiasts. 🥮【EASY TO CHANGE MOLD】-The steps to replace the mold are also very simple, and the pattern can be replaced by gently twisting the press handle.NOTE: The mold should be cleaned with water after use. After cleaning, the mold should be wiped clean with a dry cloth immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SFQg2z04L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sewepo","source_asin":"B0B7B6RVMZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-825196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7B6RVMZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7B6RVMZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
