window.products.push({"id":825299,"name":"TooGet Wedding Confetti Dried Flower Petals, 100% Natural Confetti Dried Petals Biodegradable Petal Confetti for Wedding and Party Decoration - 115g (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ucMQIJfEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌹 100% NATURAL PETALS – The wedding party confetti is made of a mixture various petals such as dark red roses petals, jasmine petals, lavender buds and chrysanthemum petals, and so on. Naturally dried, without any additives, biodegradable, natural and eco-friendly confetti, protect the environment without pollution. 🌹 PERFECT DECORATION – These dry flower petal can also be applied as table decorations and make the confetti balloons with them, or maybe you can put them into envelopes or gift boxes, and can be placed on wedding tables, wedding flower baskets, parties, dessert tables to add a romantic atmosphere. 🌹 CONFETTI DRIED FLOWER PETALS - Our petals are better for the environment & are generally accepted by churches/venues beautiful confetti that makes the perfect accompaniment for your big day. 🌹 PERFECT WEDDING DECORTION PETAL – These biodegradable dried flowers are ideal for use as throwing confetti, (Church, outdoor, seaside, hotel, meadow...) throw the flower petals when the bride and groom leave and get great photos with these light and airy petals. 🌹 HOW TO STORE - Our petals are light. Our wedding confetti will last for around one year, but we advise it be stored in a cool dry place to maintain its colors, and dry out of direct light.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ucMQIJfEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TooGet","source_asin":"B0BK3L5NFQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-825299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK3L5NFQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK3L5NFQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
