window.products.push({"id":825312,"name":"Maylibet Digital Meat Thermometer With Highly Accurate Instant Read Thermometer Probe And Electric Cooking Thermometer For Grilling Food Grill Candy B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yjp2LfkKL._AC_SL1277_.jpg","description":"Maylibet electric meat thermometer is your ideal assistant for cooking and BBQ. This kitchen cooking thermometer is accurate with instant readout within 4-6 seconds, °F/°C switchable, auto shut-off and hold feature, large LCD display. Easy to use Please insert the stainless steel meat thermometer probe into the food or liquid to get perfectly cooked temperature every time. It can be used for indoor and outdoor grilling, cooking, meat, candy, baking, oil, BBQ, milk, and even bath water. Instant read The bbq cooking thermometer uses a high precision sensor. A fast response time lets you know the temperature of food very quickly. High accuracy The digital BBQ thermometer has -58°F -572°F (-50°C ~300°C) measuring temperature range, giving you accuracy of ±1°F at temperature from -4°F~392°F (-2°C to 200°C) and ±2°F at other temperature range. °F /°C Selectable There is a °F/°C switching located inside the battery compartment of the digital kitchen thermometer. We offer you a needle to switch it. Smart design The foldable probe design makes storage easy. Important Notice 1. NEVER use the digital thermometer with probe in a closed oven, don’t touch hot probe with hand. 2. Please don’t immerse it in water or place it in dishwater, since it is not waterproof. Warranty Two year guarantee, for any possible defective products, please contact us firstly, we will offer you a replacement. Product Specifications: Measuring range: 58°F to 572°F (-50-300°C) Fast response time: 4-6seconds LCD screen, easy to read °F/°C switchable Accuracy: ± 1°F from -4°F to392°F 10 minutes auto-off Food grade ABS plastic case and stainless probe What you get 1 x digital food thermometer 1 x AAA 1.5V battery 1 x user manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yjp2LfkKL._AC_SL1277_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maylibet","source_asin":"B074PWS6N2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-825312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074PWS6N2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074PWS6N2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
