window.products.push({"id":825509,"name":"Grasslands Road Uglydoll Ket Lite Mug, 18-Ounce, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OpGdF8tnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Look, ok, so let's just say ket is smart in other ways. for example, while most of us put 4 as our answer when faced with 2+2 on a math test, ket drew little ufos in the answer column. I mean, who are we to argue with that? are there ufos? ket reply is always: do the math, want to know how to know for sure that ket is no dummy? just look at his choice in friends, yes, you. ket would like to hang out with you and talk about whatever is on your mind, as long as that means ufos or chocolate. this jumbo 18 ounce mug is made out of high gloss ceramic and is securely packaged in a very colorful, window box gift box. approximate size is 5.63-Inch tall and 3.75-Inch in diameter. mug is microwave and dishwasher safe. the more you get to know each character, the more you get attached. ugly doll characters are for all ages, collect them all.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OpGdF8tnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grasslands Road","source_asin":"B0096YA8AS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-825509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0096YA8AS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0096YA8AS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
