window.products.push({"id":825690,"name":"7 Piece Banneton Basket Set: 9 inch Round+ 10x6x4 inch Oval Sourdough Bread Basket | Bread Lame+ Dough Bowl, Bowl Scraper+ Bread Bag | Bread Proofing ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JwKDrsHsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 CREATE STUNNING OLD-FASHIONED BREADS 】The bread banneton proofing basket round 9-inch (D) x 3.5-inch (H) and the oval banneton 10-inch (L) x 6 inch (W) x 4 inch (H) Rattan Basket baking kit both hold 1.5 pounds of bread dough. Performs great with recipes involving yeast for baking or for gluten free sourdough. Whether you’re an amateur or expert using baking supplies, add our sourdough proofing basket and lame bread tool to your sourdough bread baking supplies and enjoy the experience. 【 PAY LESS AND GET MORE VALUE 】Your 7-item bread baking supplies contain: 9-inch Round Proofing Basket, 10x6x4-inch Oval bread proofer basket,1 – Reusable Bread Bags, 2 – Cloth Bread Basket Liner each (with 1.25-inches of added extra cloth to prevent shrinking), 1 – Bowl Scraper, 1 – Lame. A value packed bread making kit. Perfect bread proofing box for bread making 【 EXPERIENCE TOP QUALITY 】Your banneton proofing basket set of 2 is made from 100% natural rattan cane. Each banneton is splinter-free, smooth, non-stick, no dyes, no chemicals, and no odor. Both bread making tools and supplies work great as a proofing box. The bread bowl maintains the shape and create classic spiral patterns through the final rise in the brotform. Our bread proofing baskets used for dough proofing box are a great addition to your sourdough starter kit and dough bowl. 【 EASY TO CLEAN AND MAINTAIN 】 We provided easy to follow bread basket proofing maintenance instructions for your bread baking kit, but your sour dough proofing basket doesn’t need much maintenance. The sourdough basket basically, just needs removed any excess flour or sourdough starter from inside of the bread proofer after each use. Great proofing baskets for bread baking. 【 100% SATISFACTION NO QUESTIONS ASKED GUARANTEE 】In the unlikely event the proofing bowl in our sourdough kit does not perform to your expectations just let us know within 90 days of purchase for a prompt, full refund. It’s also covered by our one-year replacement warranty. As a small American veteran owned business, our mission focus is to meet or exceed our customers’ expectations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JwKDrsHsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S&K Kitchen Essentials","source_asin":"B07S1NGH6J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-825690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S1NGH6J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S1NGH6J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
