window.products.push({"id":825809,"name":"Pinroote Marble Shower Curtain, Blue and Grey Standard Stall Shower Curtains for Bathroom/Bathtub, Watercolor Ink Painted Abstract Art Waterproof Fabr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RLFJ01DnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester ❣FABRIC SHOWER CURTAIN: Made of high-quality polyester fabric, marble shower curtain can be used as a shower curtain lining in the bathroom or as a separate shower curtain. Cortinas de baño are environmentally friendly and durable, not easy to tear and fade, can be used for a long time. A smooth, soft and comfortable shower curtain marble with a natural drape to decorate your bathroom and surprise your life. ❣METAL GROMMETS SHOWER CURTAIN: Each of our shower curtain set with shower curtain and accessories, include 1 shower curtain(72\"W x 72\"L) and 12 plastic C-rings. Bathroom shower curtain has a firm wrap around it, the top metal grommets are tightly combined with the shower curtain, not easy to crack, the bottom is finely sewn, weighted hem, clear thread, not easy to come off and fixed in place to avoid it from sticking together or flying like some lighter curtains in the shower. ❣WATERPROOF SHOWER CURTAINS: Shower curtain for bathroom is waterproof. Water splashes on the blue marble shower curtain to form water droplets, which automatically slide off and dry quickly. Bathtub curtain can also play the role of dry and wet separation, stop water from splashing out of the bathtub, avoid embarrassment, keep the bathroom tidy and save bathroom cleaning time, creating a comfortable bathing environment. ❣STYLISH HOME DÉCOR: Farmhouse shower curtain is suitable for bathrooms, hotels, tub, themed houses, holiday homes, swimming pool, spa, and more, bringing a new decoration to your living space. Shower curtains are perfectly integrated into modern, french, rustic and retro decoration styles. Modern shower curtains can also be used as room partition curtains, dormitory curtains, wardrobe curtains, cabinet dust curtains, travel car curtains, and picnic curtains. ❣HOW TO WASH: Don't worry about how to take care of shower curtain. Just remove the curtains and put them in the washing machine. Gentle cycle wash with cold water. After washing, bathtub curtain can be air-dried or dried at low temperature. Please do not use bleach. If there are wrinkles, lightly iron on a lower temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RLFJ01DnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinroote","source_asin":"B09W1Z1ZM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-825809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W1Z1ZM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W1Z1ZM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
